Third-party content
--------------------

The photographs in vendor/seal-scroller/media/stars/ are photographs of named
animals cared for by Toba Aquarium, Osaka Aquarium Kaiyukan and the Okhotsk
Tokkari Center. They are credited on screen as "The creator" and are NOT
covered by the copyright notice above. They are included for personal,
non-commercial display only and must not be redistributed or reused.
